<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady/up $1.00- USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady/up $1.00- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were steady-$1.00 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>	 Slaughter Steers: Mostly Choice 2-4 1100-1325 lbs 64.50-66.00, part</p>
<p>load uniformly Choice 66.50. Select 63.00-65.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to largely Choice 2-4 950-1200 lbs 64.50-65.50, few 66.00-66.50. Select 61.00-64.00.</p>
</text>
